{"1022310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warhammer Underworlds - Shadespire Edition (Classic)", "steam_appid": 1022310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/46670f84048c4fefac71fca2c1ab0e3d.avif?t=1777550902\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>LEARN TO PLAY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*ALL WARBAND &amp; COSMETIC DLC NOW INCLUDED IN THE MAIN GAME!*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.poster.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.webm?t=1777550902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warhammer Underworlds – Shadespire Edition</i> is a digital adaptation of the explosive, high-stakes, turn-based strategy tabletop game from <strong>Games Workshop</strong> that pits mighty warbands from the <strong>Age of Sigmar</strong> universe against one another in an eternal player versus player battle for Glory. Choose a warband, build your decks and carve a path to victory using <strong>dice-and-card</strong> mechanics that offer boundless strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.poster.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.webm?t=1777550902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE YOUR WARBAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within the towering spires of the <strong>Mirrored City of Shadespire</strong>, fourteen warbands battle it out for survival - each with unique abilities and a distinct combat style. All of these warbands are now available to play in online matches, bot matches or single-player challenges, having previously been available as DLC! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable warbands:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steelheart’s Champions - Magore's Fiends - Garrek’s Reavers - The Sepulchral Guard – Spiteclaw’s Swarm – The Farstriders – The Chosen Axes – Ironskull’s Boyz – Thorns of the Briar Queen – Eyes of the Nine – Drepur’s Wraithcreepers – The Storm of Celestus – Stormsire’s Cursebreakers – Mollog’s Mob</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.poster.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.webm?t=1777550902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT YOUR DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your success is measured in Glory points - awarded for achieving objectives and vanquishing your foes. <strong>Deckbuilding</strong> is the strategic heart of <i>Warhammer Underworlds – Shadespire Edition</i>. Your <strong>20-card power deck</strong> is filled with clever gambits, powerful upgrades, and cunning spells you’ll need to inflict maximum damage. Your<strong> 12-card objective deck</strong> will shape your tactical approach to a match, allowing you to score Glory by fulfilling specific conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.poster.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.webm?t=1777550902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLAIM THE SPOILS OF SHADESPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>rewarding progression</strong> system in both online matches and single-player Challenges allows you to earn cosmetic content including warband skins, deck portraits, and player titles! Only those who have proven themselves in the unforgiving streets of Shadespire will be able to claim these rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/1b136ef0c271b521ce2f7801d5c0c037.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Warhammer Classics</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warhammer Classics is a collection of the greatest titles from the annals of Warhammer video game history, spanning the last 30 years, brought back to life as a series to celebrate their iconic legacy. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Because of their classic nature, some of the content may not accurately reflect current depictions, lore, or presentation within the current Warhammer universes and settings</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*ALL WARBAND &amp; COSMETIC DLC NOW INCLUDED IN THE MAIN GAME!*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.poster.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.webm?t=1777550902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warhammer Underworlds – Shadespire Edition</i> is a digital adaptation of the explosive, high-stakes, turn-based strategy tabletop game from <strong>Games Workshop</strong> that pits mighty warbands from the <strong>Age of Sigmar</strong> universe against one another in an eternal player versus player battle for Glory. Choose a warband, build your decks and carve a path to victory using <strong>dice-and-card</strong> mechanics that offer boundless strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.poster.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.webm?t=1777550902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE YOUR WARBAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within the towering spires of the <strong>Mirrored City of Shadespire</strong>, fourteen warbands battle it out for survival - each with unique abilities and a distinct combat style. All of these warbands are now available to play in online matches, bot matches or single-player challenges, having previously been available as DLC! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable warbands:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steelheart’s Champions - Magore's Fiends - Garrek’s Reavers - The Sepulchral Guard – Spiteclaw’s Swarm – The Farstriders – The Chosen Axes – Ironskull’s Boyz – Thorns of the Briar Queen – Eyes of the Nine – Drepur’s Wraithcreepers – The Storm of Celestus – Stormsire’s Cursebreakers – Mollog’s Mob</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.poster.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.webm?t=1777550902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT YOUR DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your success is measured in Glory points - awarded for achieving objectives and vanquishing your foes. <strong>Deckbuilding</strong> is the strategic heart of <i>Warhammer Underworlds – Shadespire Edition</i>. Your <strong>20-card power deck</strong> is filled with clever gambits, powerful upgrades, and cunning spells you’ll need to inflict maximum damage. Your<strong> 12-card objective deck</strong> will shape your tactical approach to a match, allowing you to score Glory by fulfilling specific conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.poster.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.webm?t=1777550902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLAIM THE SPOILS OF SHADESPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>rewarding progression</strong> system in both online matches and single-player Challenges allows you to earn cosmetic content including warband skins, deck portraits, and player titles! Only those who have proven themselves in the unforgiving streets of Shadespire will be able to claim these rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/1b136ef0c271b521ce2f7801d5c0c037.avif?t=1777550902\" width=616 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Warhammer Classics</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warhammer Classics is a collection of the greatest titles from the annals of Warhammer video game history, spanning the last 30 years, brought back to life as a series to celebrate their iconic legacy. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Because of their classic nature, some of the content may not accurately reflect current depictions, lore, or presentation within the current Warhammer universes and settings</i></p>", "short_description": "Lead your fighters to Glory in the ultimate PvP dice-and-cards strategy combat game. Warhammer Underworlds - Shadespire Edition pits mighty warbands against one another in an eternal battle for glory in the realms of the Age of Sigmar.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian", "reviews": "“It's rare to see a game merge deckbuilding, tabletop tactics, dice, and card combat into one elegant combat system, but that's exactly what Warhammer Underworlds does, and there's huge potential for future expansion if the tabletop game is anything to go by.”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“Warhammer Underworlds is an incredible tabletop game. It nails a load of elements that a lot of tabletop gamers look for. It plays fast, it’s competitive, and it’s quick to set up. There are deck building elements for added variety. Most importantly, it’s incredibly fun, and Warhammer Underworlds Online captures all of that in a tight, digital package...”<br>TechRaptor<br><br>“...the title has the potential to be one of the most strategic competitive games on the market...”<br>Screen Rant<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/89e9051aee6763e20d82d79b4f362a9b357582ef/header.jpg?t=1777550902", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/fb99594f1ce39575d40878562b430028024fbfa6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777550902", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/fb99594f1ce39575d40878562b430028024fbfa6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777550902", "website": "https://tinmangames.com.au/games/warhammer-underworlds-online/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7, 64-bit Windows 8 (8.1) or 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 @ 2.80 GHz / AMD FX-4350 @ 4.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 460 or AMD Radeon HD 5870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Warhammer Underworlds - Shadespire Edition © Copyright Games Workshop Limited 2023. Warhammer Underworlds - Shadespire Edition, Warhammer Underworlds: Online, the Warhammer Underworlds logo, GW, Gam